OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged in connection with
OL,4,Adamage to Belfast's Big Fish sculpture
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged by police
OL,7,Finvestigating damage to one of
OL,8,FBelfast's most iconic sculptures.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Donegall Quay
OL,11,Faround 00:30 BST on Sunday after
OL,12,Freports that the left eye of the Big
OL,13,FFish sculpture had been damaged.
OL,15,FA 44-year-old man has been charged with
OL,16,Fcriminal damage and possession of an
OL,17,Foffensive weapon in a public place.
OL,19,FHe is due to appear before Belfast
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
